CLIProxyAPI
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

ModelDeck embeds a CLIProxyAPI binary built from pinned, unmodified upstream
source. The exact pin (repository, tag, commit, Go toolchain) is recorded in
scripts/cliproxyapi-pin.json — the single authority — and travels inside the
app at Contents/Resources/cliproxyapi-pin.json. At the time of writing:

  Source: https://github.com/router-for-me/CLIProxyAPI
  Tag:    v7.2.130
  Commit: f43aad7637ad813745bf7d341acb5663617570c5

